# Export one drama's session (blueprint.json, every blueprint version, host_inputs, engine events, chat history, perf)
# with the AI Mini Drama debug info (REQ-068), for an eBug that needs the blueprint. Run it when the finding is made:
# a reinstall or `pm clear` wipes History and the session with it.
# Starts: the 「Hi, I'm your AI Drama Assistant」 page. Ends: the drama's chat with debug info still ON (turn it off with
# `back` then `debug-info off` before test cases continue).
# Charges nothing: opens the drama from History and only reads it.
# Args: $1 = the drama's title in History (exact), $2 = output folder (default <run dir>/exports/); add --media after
# the recipe call's args only by editing the last line (media makes the zip much bigger).
# Written 2026-11-03 on 16.8.0 (2610212), tested on 「Crossed Wires」.
debug-info on
id button_mini_drama_home_history
wait 2
scrollto "$1"
tapif "$1"
wait 4
debug-export $2
